{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43138","headline":"秋日寄弟 · 赵防","name":"秋日寄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凉风飒庭户，渐疑华发侵。\n已经杨柳谢，犹听蟪蛄吟。\n雨助滩声出，云连野色深。\n鶺鴒今在远，年酒共谁斟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43138.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43138","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}